    Note over A,R: t+2.0 s — key expires.<br/>Nobody is told.
    rect rgb(253,236,238)
    Note over A: FROZEN (stop-the-world, 3.1 s)<br/>A still believes it holds the lock
    B->>R: SET lock:S2A-0007<br/>B NX PX 2000
    R-->>B: OK
    B->>DB: write checksum<br/>= 4f1c… (B)
    end
    Note over A: A resumes
    A->>DB: write checksum<br/>= 91ab… (A, stale)
    DB-->>A: accepted
    Note over DB: the surviving row<br/>is the older result
